## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Haiku 4.5
- **Short description:** Anthropic's small, fast Haiku-class model released October 2025. Positioned as a cost-efficient coding and agent workhorse; marketed as matching Sonnet 4 performance on coding/computer use with ~1/3 cost and >2x speed. Legacy model; successor is Claude Haiku 5.5.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic Claude Messages API `claude-haiku-4-5-20251001` alias `claude-haiku-4-5`; Amazon Bedrock `anthropic.claude-haiku-4-5`; Google Cloud Vertex `claude-haiku-4-5@20251001`; Microsoft Foundry. Chat Completions style Messages API with tool use and extended thinking.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2025-10-15 release; reliable knowledge cutoff Feb 2025, training data cutoff Jul 2025
- **IDs:** `anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5-20251001` ; alias `claude-haiku-4-5`. No free tier ID on Zen.
- **Context window:** 200K tokens total; max output 64K tokens. Verified from platform docs https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/haiku-4-5/overview
- **Modalities:** Text and images input → text output; reasoning yes via manual extended thinking budget_tokens; tool use yes; JSON mode supported via Messages API
- **Pricing (as of 2026-10-25):** $1 / MTok input, $5 / MTok output; 5m cache write $1.25 / MTok, 1h cache write $2 / MTok, cache read $0.10 / MTok; Batch API 50% discount. Paid; no free tier.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary; parameters not disclosed; not open-weights

